# Generated block metadata, rebuilt by `npm run blocks` (and by CI before every
# build) from the .block.yml in the submodules plus blocks/overlays/. Committing
# them put a regenerated 2 MB artifact in the diff of every block change, and the
# committed copy was never what shipped -- CI regenerates both first either way.
/editor/public/blocks.json
/runner/generated_blocks.json
